note for_latch_i64: as for_latch_i8 with a long counter: after one pass the body sets k to 2^63 - 1 and the
note latch's add 1 must trap 1 (exit 101), as omc's latch (binop 33 at s_end) does. Bug hunt, ledger L1060.
fn main to int
n = int 0
for k long 10 bound 5
n = add n 1
if eq k 0
k = 9223372036854775807
end
end
ret n
end
